 "entries": [
  {
   "step": "原因 / 做法第 1 步",
   "fact": "Scroll 只支持单个子组件；子组件的布局尺寸超过 Scroll 的尺寸时内容可以滚动，放进 Scroll 的节点都随内容滚动",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-container-scroll.md，子组件；https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-container-scroll.md，Scroll",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 1、2 步",
   "fact": "layoutWeight 只在 Row、Column、Flex 中生效，不写时为 0：父容器尺寸确定时，不设或为 0 的子组件先占位，设了大于 0 的子组件按权重分主轴剩余空间，分配时忽略自身 width/height 但保留 minWidth/minHeight 约束；容器里有子组件设了大于 0 的 layoutWeight 时，所有子组件不再按 flexShrink、flexGrow 布局",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-universal-attributes-size.md，layoutWeight；鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/common.d.ts，CommonMethod.layoutWeight",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 1 步",
   "fact": "Scroll 的高度超出屏幕显示范围时，可以通过 layoutWeight 让 Scroll 高度适应父容器主轴的剩余空间",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-container-scroll.md，Scroll",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "新查"
  }
 ],
